                                    <div class="globx-testi-quote-mark">"</div>
                                    <p>
                                        The Globx expertise is unmatched. They reimagined how
                                        we work.
                                    </p>
                                    <div class="globx-testi-footer">
                                        <div class="globx-testi-avatar"/>
                                        <div>
                                            <b>Operations Director</b>
                                            <span>Retail client</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <div class="globx-testi-bubble">
                                    <div class="globx-testi-quote-mark">"</div>
                                    <p>
                                        Seamless migration with zero downtime. Our long-term
                                        digital partner.
                                    </p>
                                    <div class="globx-testi-footer">
                                        <div class="globx-testi-avatar"/>
                                        <div>
                                            <b>IT Manager</b>
                                            <span>Logistics client</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->
                <footer class="globx_footer py-5">
                    <div class="container">
                        <div class="row gy-4">
                            <div class="col-lg-6">
                                <b class="d-block mb-2">GlobX</b>
                                <p class="mb-0">
                                    Official Odoo Silver Partner. Empowering East Africa,
                                    India, and UAE with intelligent ERP solutions since 2018.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-3">
                                <b class="d-block mb-2">Quick Links</b>
                                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                                    <li><a href="/solutions">Solutions</a></li>
                                    <li><a href="/casestudies">Case Studies</a></li>
